@Vacate.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:7071

GET {{Vacate.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Explicitly enabled fictional API only. Copy accessToken from this response.
POST {{Vacate.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"nora","password":"nora"}

### Replace the placeholder with your short-lived local demo token.
@demoToken = replace-with-local-demo-accessToken
GET {{Vacate.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/sessions/current
Authorization: Bearer {{demoToken}}

### Administrator membership configuration (Maya)
PATCH {{Vacate.Api_HostAddress}}/api/organizations/20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000100/memberships/20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004
Authorization: Bearer {{demoToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"priorService":3.5,"hireDate":"2024-01-01","customAllocation":27}

### Organization update
PATCH {{Vacate.Api_HostAddress}}/api/organizations/20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000100
Authorization: Bearer {{demoToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Northstar Example","workWeekDays":5}
